---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';

const pageTitle = "Terms of Service | Lakeland Repair";
const pageDescription = "Terms of service, consumer referral disclosures, independent contractor terms, and liability limits for Lakeland Repair.";
---

<BaseLayout title={pageTitle} description={pageDescription}>
  
  <!-- Custom Legal Hero -->
  <section class="relative bg-brand-teal text-white overflow-hidden py-16 lg:py-24 border-b border-teal-800">
    <div class="absolute inset-0 bg-[radial-gradient(ellipse_at_top_right,_var(--tw-gradient-stops))] from-teal-700/40 via-brand-teal-dark to-brand-teal-dark z-0"></div>
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 relative z-10 text-center">
      <div class="inline-flex items-center space-x-2 px-3.5 py-1.5 rounded-full bg-teal-800/80 border border-teal-600/50 text-teal-100 text-xs font-semibold tracking-wide uppercase mb-6">
        <svg class="w-4 h-4 text-brand-amber" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M9 12l2 2 4-4m5.618-4.016A11.955 11.955 0 0112 2.944a11.955 11.955 0 01-8.618 3.04A12.02 12.02 0 003 9c0 5.591 3.824 10.29 9 11.622 5.176-1.332 9-6.03 9-11.622 0-1.042-.133-2.052-.382-3.016z"/></svg>
        <span>Legal Documentation</span>
      </div>
      <h1 class="text-4xl sm:text-5xl font-heading font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight mb-4">
        Terms of Service
      </h1>
      <p class="text-teal-100/80 text-sm">Last Updated: September 2026</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-16 sm:py-24 bg-brand-surface">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <div class="bg-white rounded-3xl shadow-xl border border-gray-100 p-8 sm:p-12 lg:p-16">
        
        <div class="prose prose-slate prose-lg max-w-none text-gray-600 marker:text-brand-teal">
          
          <div class="bg-brand-teal/5 border-l-4 border-brand-teal p-6 rounded-r-2xl mb-12">
            <p class="m-0 font-medium text-brand-teal-dark">
              Please read these Terms of Service carefully before utilizing our website or calling our dispatch phone numbers. By accessing this website or placing a call to our service numbers, you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.
            </p>
          </div>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-teal-dark mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">1. Nature of the Service & Referral Platform</h2>
          <p>
            Lakeland Repair ("Website", "we", "us", or "our") operates strictly as an independent consumer marketing, information, and referral service. Our platform connects consumers located in Lakeland and Polk County, Florida seeking residential and commercial appliance repair services with third-party, independent repair contractors and service technicians.
          </p>
          <p>
            <strong>Lakeland Repair does not own, manage, or employ repair technicians, nor does Lakeland Repair directly perform appliance repair services.</strong> All technicians, trade specialists, and repair companies within our referral network operate as independent contractors.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-teal-dark mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">2. Independent Contractor Relationship</h2>
          <p>
            You acknowledge and agree that any contract, agreement, or arrangement for appliance repair, diagnostics, estimates, parts replacement, or warranty work is made solely between you (the consumer) and the independent service contractor assigned to or fulfilling your service request.
          </p>
          <p>
            Lakeland Repair is not an agent, partner, joint venturer, or employer of any independent contractor. We do not control the methods, pricing, scheduling, or workmanship of the third-party contractors.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-teal-dark mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">3. Verification of Contractor Licensing & Insurance</h2>
          <p>
            While we endeavor to connect users with qualified local service providers, <strong>it is the customer's sole responsibility to independently confirm and verify that the matched contractor possesses all appropriate state and local trade licenses, EPA certifications, bonding, and liability insurance</strong> before permitting any work to begin on your property or appliance.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-teal-dark mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">4. Pricing, Diagnostic Fees, and Payments</h2>
          <p>
            Any pricing references, diagnostic fee structures, or discounts mentioned on this website are general estimates. Final pricing, diagnostic rates, OEM parts costs, and labor charges are determined and provided directly by the independent service contractor prior to commencing work.
          </p>
          <p>
            All payments for diagnostic assessments or completed repairs are made directly to the servicing contractor or their company according to their accepted payment methods.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-teal-dark mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">5. Warranty Terms and Guarantees</h2>
          <p>
            Any warranty covering parts or labor (including standard 90-day guarantees) is extended directly and solely by the independent technician or service company that completes the repair. Lakeland Repair does not warrant, guarantee, or insure the performance, safety, legality, or durability of any repair or parts supplied by third-party contractors.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-teal-dark mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">6. Communications Consent (TCPA) & Call Recording</h2>
          <p>
            By calling any phone number on this website or submitting a request, you grant express consent to receive live telephone calls, automated calls, prerecorded messages, and SMS/MMS text messages from Lakeland Repair and its network of local contractor partners regarding your repair inquiry.
          </p>
          <p>
            You also acknowledge that telephone calls may be recorded and monitored for quality assurance, compliance, and training purposes.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-teal-dark mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">7. Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
          <p>
            THIS WEBSITE AND THE REFERRAL SERVICES ARE PROVIDED ON AN "AS IS" AND "AS AVAILABLE" BASIS WITHOUT WARRANTIES OF ANY KIND, EITHER EXPRESS OR IMPLIED, INCLUDING BUT NOT LIMITED TO IMPLIED WARRANTIES OF MERCHANTABILITY, FITNESS FOR A PARTICULAR PURPOSE, WORKMANSHIP, OR NON-INFRINGEMENT.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-teal-dark mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">8. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            TO THE FULLEST EXTENT PERMITTED UNDER APPLICABLE LAW, LAKELAND REPAIR, ITS OWNERS, OPERATORS, AFFILIATES, OFFICERS, AND AGENTS SHALL NOT BE LIABLE FOR ANY DIRECT, INDIRECT, INCIDENTAL, SPECIAL, CONSEQUENTIAL, OR PUNITIVE DAMAGES ARISING OUT OF OR IN CONNECTION WITH:
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>YOUR USE OF OR INABILITY TO USE THIS WEBSITE;</li>
            <li>ANY REPAIRS, WORKMANSHIP, ESTIMATES, ACTS, OMISSIONS, DELAYS, PROPERTY DAMAGE, OR PERSONAL INJURY CAUSED BY INDEPENDENT CONTRACTORS;</li>
            <li>ANY DISPUTES OR TRANSACTIONS BETWEEN YOU AND A THIRD-PARTY REPAIR TECHNICIAN.</li>
          </ul>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-teal-dark mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">9. Indemnification</h2>
          <p>
            You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless Lakeland Repair, its operators, affiliates, and representatives from and against any claims, liabilities, damages, losses, and expenses (including reasonable attorney fees) arising out of your use of the website, violation of these Terms, or interactions with matched independent contractors.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-teal-dark mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">10. Dispute Resolution & Mandatory Arbitration</h2>
          <p>
            Any dispute or claim arising out of or relating to these Terms of Service or your use of the referral platform shall be resolved through binding individual arbitration administered under the rules of the American Arbitration Association, rather than in court. You agree to waive any right to participate in a class action lawsuit or class-wide arbitration.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-teal-dark mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">11. Governing Law & Jurisdiction</h2>
          <p>
            These Terms of Service shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the State of Florida, without giving effect to any principles of conflicts of law. Any legal proceedings not subject to arbitration shall be brought exclusively in the state or federal courts located in Polk County, Florida.
          </p>

          <h2 class="text-2xl font-heading font-bold text-brand-teal-dark mt-10 mb-4 border-b border-gray-100 pb-4">12. Contact Information</h2>
          <div class="bg-gray-50 p-6 rounded-2xl border border-gray-100 mt-6">
            <p class="m-0 text-sm">
              If you have any questions regarding these Terms of Service, please contact our administrative desk:<br><br>
              <strong>Lakeland Repair Administrative Desk</strong><br>
              120 E Pine St, Suite 4<br>
              Lakeland, FL 33801<br>
              Phone: <a href="tel:+18632780714" class="text-brand-amber font-bold hover:underline">(863) 278-0714</a>
            </p>
          </div>

        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
